# scenario: cancelled-root-document
# doc: cancelled-root-document.md
# given: invoked as `claudine compose --claude cancelled-root-document.md` from the directory holding the fixture documents
# given: the document authors a cancelled stack
# given: launch 1 sends SIGINT to claudine while it runs (a Ctrl+C) and is ended by the forwarded interrupt
# given: the interrupt is reported to the cleanup events as provider.interrupted
event initialize
event start
work fresh 130
event cancelled
err provider.interrupted
event finalize
err provider.interrupted
exit 130
